00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:39.200
Fundamental predisposition of bullish,
stick it on the watch list and wait.

00:22:40.180 --> 00:22:41.620
You might be right 12 months from now.

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:45.700
The stock could be $30 in 12 months.

00:22:46.400 --> 00:22:48.260
But at the moment, the timing is poor.

00:22:49.940 --> 00:22:55.680
You want to see that stabilize and break
in some way back before you take a
position.

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:03.340
What about a double bottom with a break
down?

00:23:03.760 --> 00:23:05.260
A false breakout, we call it.

00:23:09.640 --> 00:23:11.120
Fundamental predisposition of bullish.

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:13.720
What do you do?

00:23:16.400 --> 00:23:17.480
With a false breakout.

00:23:21.760 --> 00:23:22.720
Neither here nor there.

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:23.500
It's an amber.

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:27.420
Stick it on the watch list.

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:30.860
If it goes a bit lower, maybe you might
buy some around support.

00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:35.060
Fundamental predisposition of bearish.

00:23:35.900 --> 00:23:37.280
It's amber or red.

00:23:38.280 --> 00:23:39.780
Just let it break support and short it.

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:42.720
You want momentum behind your idea.

00:23:46.760 --> 00:23:49.420
You'll see a lot of these bullish flags.

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:54.800
Where basically buyers have stepped into
