00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:07.540
A bullish flag.

00:24:10.400 --> 00:24:11.320
What not to do.

00:24:13.320 --> 00:24:15.400
If your fundamental predisposition is
bearish.

00:24:15.780 --> 00:24:17.300
Short on a flag breakout.

00:24:20.040 --> 00:24:21.680
Fundamental predisposition is bullish.

00:24:22.880 --> 00:24:24.420
Buy on a flag breakout.

