00:24:43.320 --> 00:24:45.620
Fundamental predisposition is bearish
here.

00:24:46.600 --> 00:24:47.460
Don't do anything.

00:24:48.260 --> 00:24:49.180
Stick it on the watch list.

00:24:49.720 --> 00:24:51.460
If your fundamental predisposition is
bullish.

00:24:52.040 --> 00:24:52.760
Get involved.

00:24:53.840 --> 00:24:54.680
Don't be afraid.

00:24:56.860 --> 00:24:57.800
Totally the opposite.

00:25:00.160 --> 00:25:01.040
Bearish flag.

00:25:01.920 --> 00:25:03.080
Opposite of bullish flag.

00:25:06.380 --> 00:25:07.920
Sellers have stepped into the market.

00:25:08.660 --> 00:25:09.720
They're trying to sell.

00:25:10.680 --> 00:25:11.500
For higher prices.

00:25:12.080 --> 00:25:12.780
But then eventually.

00:25:12.940 --> 00:25:14.520
They have to accept lower prices.

00:25:17.320 --> 00:25:19.400
If your fundamental predisposition is
bullish.

00:25:19.780 --> 00:25:21.060
The momentum here is down.

00:25:24.900 --> 00:25:25.620
Do nothing.

00:25:26.280 --> 00:25:27.080
Stick it on the watch list.

00:25:30.980 --> 00:25:33.000
Your fundamental predisposition is
bearish.

00:25:33.300 --> 00:25:34.020
Jump all over it.

00:25:36.820 --> 00:25:38.440
Same with a bearish pennant.

00:25:40.620 --> 00:25:41.820
What about with volume?

00:25:41.980 --> 00:25:42.900
When you look at volume.

00:25:45.180 --> 00:25:46.320
So it's the same again.

00:25:49.740 --> 00:25:50.740
Large moves.

00:25:51.220 --> 00:25:52.200
In assets.

00:25:55.040 --> 00:25:56.960
Combined with big amounts of volume.

00:25:57.320 --> 00:25:58.880
Or higher than normal amounts of volume.

00:26:00.440 --> 00:26:02.240
If you're bullish in this situation.

00:26:03.020 --> 00:26:03.900
And you're seeing.

00:26:06.400 --> 00:26:07.200
Big volume.

00:26:07.600 --> 00:26:08.140
In this move.

00:26:10.860 --> 00:26:12.740
As in the highest volume it's been for a
