But we'll look at simple moving average.

00:29:17.380 --> 00:29:17.800
SMA.

00:29:18.160 --> 00:29:20.160
Just to get the principles covered.

00:29:23.360 --> 00:29:27.840
So it just tells you whether momentum is
building in the asset or not.

00:29:28.520 --> 00:29:29.800
Or momentum is slowing down.

00:29:33.420 --> 00:29:38.540
So if you look at a typical situation
where you're looking at very short-term
moving averages.

