What does 200 days represent?

00:32:32.760 --> 00:32:36.920
These are the most common used moving
averages in the market.

00:32:37.100 --> 00:32:38.920
By technical analysis themselves.

00:32:39.880 --> 00:32:40.020
Right?

00:32:42.020 --> 00:32:43.520
What does 200 days mean?

00:32:44.900 --> 00:32:46.220
I don't say four times 50.

00:32:50.400 --> 00:32:59.280
Well, don't they use 200 because it's the
number of days where there's no big
structural change in the economy.

00:33:00.280 --> 00:33:02.220
Like everything that happens is still
relevant.

00:33:04.080 --> 00:33:04.480
Okay.

00:33:05.220 --> 00:33:06.840
So why not 199 days?

