Because it's a round number.

00:33:10.420 --> 00:33:13.440
You just hit the nail on the head because
it's a round number.

00:33:13.820 --> 00:33:15.500
It literally doesn't mean anything.

00:33:16.980 --> 00:33:18.000
It's a trick question.

00:33:18.000 --> 00:33:18.000
It's a trick question.

00:33:21.660 --> 00:33:23.080
50 doesn't mean anything.

00:33:23.340 --> 00:33:24.480
200 doesn't mean anything.

00:33:25.240 --> 00:33:28.860
So what are the meaningful moving averages
in the stock market?

00:33:29.860 --> 00:33:31.180
What are we trading here?

