00:36:27.600 --> 00:36:29.760
What are the most important moving
averages to me?

00:36:31.580 --> 00:36:33.020
Just ask the obvious question.

00:36:35.860 --> 00:36:39.080
So you can add any TA indicator in there
you want.

00:36:39.780 --> 00:36:42.220
But that outlines the approach.

00:36:43.120 --> 00:36:51.180
Your fundamental predisposition, whether
it agrees, confirms, or denies what you're
thinking.

00:36:52.820 --> 00:36:59.860
That's going to stop you doing something
stupid, i.e. buying something at 100,
getting stopped out at 92, then it goes to
