00:37:04.100 --> 00:37:05.640
Feel free to add anything in.

00:37:07.200 --> 00:37:11.320
Don't confuse TA with a tool that
generates the idea for you.

00:37:14.140 --> 00:37:18.200
You need to have your view before you pull
up the chart.

00:37:21.800 --> 00:37:32.700
A good trade is going to be one that
agrees with your world view, agrees with
your industry view in the stock market,
and your stock view, and technically is
starting to work.

00:37:35.200 --> 00:37:36.700
That's when all the boxes are ticked.

00:37:37.000 --> 00:37:38.220
That's when all the planets are aligned.

00:37:39.840 --> 00:37:45.440
That's when you say, as the gatekeeper,
I'm happy now to allow capital to go into
