00:40:02.620 --> 00:40:08.880
So, please make sure that you do not go
against your fundamental predisposition
when you pull up a chart.

00:40:09.020 --> 00:40:12.900
That's just a really, really amateur,
amateur mistake.

00:40:14.400 --> 00:40:29.580
So, technical analysis, as part of the
gatekeeping process, just to summarise, is
one of these things that you put up as a
barrier between your ideas and your real
capital before you commit money to a
trade.

00:40:29.920 --> 00:40:42.180
You're trying to use it as a tool to
essentially add value to your potentially
good trade, because at the moment, your
